THIRD-PARTY DATA

The file src/dataportalen/vocabulary.json is generated data, not source code.
The MIT License above covers this package's code; it does not override the
terms of the data, which is redistributed from:

  DCAT-AP-SE, Myndigheten for digital forvaltning (DIGG)
  Swedish and English vocabulary labels
  https://github.com/diggsweden/DCAT-AP-SE
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  GeoNames geographical database
  Place names for dcterms:spatial, from the SE.zip and countryInfo.txt exports
  https://www.geonames.org/
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

  EU Vocabularies, Publications Office of the European Union
  Data themes, file types, frequencies, languages, access rights, availability
  https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies
  Reusable under Commission Decision 2011/833/EU
  https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dec/2011/833/oj

  INSPIRE registry, European Commission
  INSPIRE themes, topic categories and related code lists
  https://inspire.ec.europa.eu/registry
  Reusable under Commission Decision 2011/833/EU

No third-party data is fetched at runtime. Metadata retrieved from
dataportal.se through this package is published by its respective publishers,
each under its own license - see the license field on every dataset.
